{"14": [{"l": "Ganthārambhakathā", "k": "sutta"}, {"l": "Yo sabbalokātigasabbasobhā-\nYuttehi sabbehi guṇehi yutto.\nDosehi sabbehi savāsanehi,\nMutto vimuttiṁ paramañca1 dātā.\nNiccaṁ dayācandanasītacitto,\nPaññāravijjotitasabbaneyyo.\nSabbesu bhūtesu tamaggabhūtaṁ,\nBhūtatthanāthaṁ sirasā namitvā.\nYo sabbabhūtesu2 Munīva aggo,\nAnantasaṅkhesu Jinattajesu3.\nAhū dayāñāṇaguṇehi Satthu-\nLīlānukārī janatāhitesu.\nTaṁ Sāriputtaṁ Munirājaputtaṁ,\nTheraṁ thirānekaguṇābhirāmaṁ.\nPaññāpabhāvuggatacārukittiṁ,\nSusantavuttiñca atho namitvā.\nSaddhammacakkānupavattakena,\nSaddhammasenāpatisāvakena.\nSuttesu vuttesu Tathāgatena,\nBhūtatthavedittamupāgatena.\nYo bhāsito bhāsitakovidena,\nDhammappadīpujjalanāyakena.\nPāṭho visiṭṭho paṭisambhidānaṁ,\nMaggoti tannāmavisesito ca.\nVicittanānattanayopagūḷho,\nGambhīrapaññehi sadāvagāḷho.\nAttatthalokatthaparāyaṇehi,\nSaṁsevanīyo sujanehi niccaṁ.\nÑāṇappabhedāvahanassa tassa,\nYogīhinekehi nisevitassa.\nAtthaṁ apubbaṁ anuvaṇṇayanto,\nSuttañca yuttiñca anukkamanto.\nAvokkamanto samayā sakā ca,\nAnāmasanto samayaṁ parañca.\nPubbopadesaṭṭhakathānayañca,\nYathānurūpaṁ upasaṁharanto.\nVakkhāmahaṁ Aṭṭhakathaṁ janassa,\nHitāya saddhammaciraṭṭhitatthaṁ.", "k": "gatha"}], "15": [{"l": "1. Mahāvagga", "k": "vagga"}, {"l": "1. Ñāṇakathā", "k": "sutta"}, {"l": "mātikāvaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "73": [{"l": "1. Sutamayañāṇakathā", "k": "sutta"}, {"l": "Vissajjanuddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "74": [{"l": "Abhiññeyyaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "93": [{"l": "Pariññeyyaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "95": [{"l": "Pahātabbaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "97": [{"l": "Bhāvetabbaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "101": [{"l": "Sacchikātabbaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "102": [{"l": "Hānabhāgiyacatukkaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "103": [{"l": "Lakkhaṇattikaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "104": [{"l": "Dukkhasaccaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "105": [{"l": "Samudayasaccaniddesavaṇṇanā", "k": "sutta"}], "106": [{"l": "Nirodhasaccan